      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I can help you brainstorm generic, routine administrative subject line formats based on standard bureaucratic structures. We can create various patterns that mimic logistical reporting or resource management, such as \"PROJ-Q3-REVIEW,\" \"FAC-DATA-SYNC,\" or \"ADM-PROC-04B.\" These formats are designed to appear as standard internal tracking codes for operational flow. Remember that the actual content of the message will determine its true level of sensitivity.",
